 "synopsis": "Muthoot FinCorp is planning an initial public offering to raise 3,000 crore rupees through a fresh issue of shares. The non-banking financial company intends to use the proceeds to strengthen its Tier I capital base and support future capital requirements, including onward lending. The proposed listing comes as the company seeks to expand its reach in rural and semi-urban markets, broaden its secured lending products beyond gold loans, and scale its wealth management and digital platforms to increase fee-based income.",
